msgid ""
"The output is a three-band GeoTIFF: `dx`, `dy` (ground metres) and `snr`."
msgstr ""
"La salida es un GeoTIFF de tres bandas: `dx`, `dy` (metros sobre el terreno)"
" y `snr`."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/cli.md:165
